{"id":"71fe8c583a58e15f","group":"28","path":"28/28-df-computational-indistinguishability.md","title":"Computational Indistinguishability","display":"df-computational-indistinguishability — Computational Indistinguishability","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-df-computational-indistinguishability","aliases":["28-df-computational-indistinguishability","Computational Indistinguishability"],"display":"df-computational-indistinguishability — Computational Indistinguishability","depends_on":["[[28-df-ensemble]]","[[28-df-ppt]]","[[28-df-negl]]","[[28-df-binary-pair-encoding]]"],"source_book_location":"§9.2.3 and §9.4 computational relaxation; printed pp.179–180,188; PDF pp.205–206,214","source_printed_pages":"179–180,188","source_pdf_pages":"205–206,214","source_status":"supplementary-formalization"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-df-computational-indistinguishability"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-df-computational-indistinguishability</span><span>Computational Indistinguishability</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-computational-indistinguishability — Computational Indistinguishability"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"46982b39fb15e783\" href=\"?note=46982b39fb15e783\" title=\"28-df-ensemble\">28-df-ensemble</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b75200f005282ddf\" href=\"?note=b75200f005282ddf\" title=\"28-df-ppt\">28-df-ppt</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"f3171800627deef3\" href=\"?note=f3171800627deef3\" title=\"28-df-negl\">28-df-negl</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"0dfeff4bd5d69b86\" href=\"?note=0dfeff4bd5d69b86\" title=\"28-df-binary-pair-encoding\">28-df-binary-pair-encoding</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_book_location","html":"§9.2.3 and §9.4 computational relaxation; printed pp.179–180,188; PDF pp.205–206,214"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"179–180,188"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"205–206,214"},{"key":"source_status","html":"supplementary-formalization"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal X=(X_n)_{n\\in\\mathbb N},\\mathcal Y=(Y_n)_{n\\in\\mathbb N}\\in\\operatorname{Ens}(\\mathbb N)\">\\(\\mathcal X=(X_n)_{n\\in\\mathbb N},\\mathcal Y=(Y_n)_{n\\in\\mathbb N}\\in\\operatorname{Ens}(\\mathbb N)\\)</span>，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"46982b39fb15e783\" href=\"?note=46982b39fb15e783\" title=\"28-df-ensemble\">28-df-ensemble</a>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a,c\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\">\\(a,c\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\)</span>，对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{supp}(X_n)\\cup\\operatorname{supp}(Y_n)\\subseteq\\{0,1\\}^{\\le c(n+1)^a}\">\\(\\operatorname{supp}(X_n)\\cup\\operatorname{supp}(Y_n)\\subseteq\\{0,1\\}^{\\le c(n+1)^a}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\\in\\mathbf{PPT}\">\\(D\\in\\mathbf{PPT}\\)</span> 为均匀随机多项式时间的一比特输出区分器，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"b75200f005282ddf\" href=\"?note=b75200f005282ddf\" title=\"28-df-ppt\">28-df-ppt</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Negl}\">\\(\\mathrm{Negl}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"f3171800627deef3\" href=\"?note=f3171800627deef3\" title=\"28-df-negl\">28-df-negl</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{pair}_{01}\">\\(\\operatorname{pair}_{01}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"0dfeff4bd5d69b86\" href=\"?note=0dfeff4bd5d69b86\" title=\"28-df-binary-pair-encoding\">28-df-binary-pair-encoding</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D(1^n,z)\\coloneqq D(\\operatorname{pair}_{01}(1^n,z))\">\\(D(1^n,z)\\coloneqq D(\\operatorname{pair}_{01}(1^n,z))\\)</span>；概率同时取遍分布样本与区分器的独立随机性。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\approx_c\">\\(\\approx_c\\)</span> 为以下关系。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal X\\approx_c\\mathcal Y\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\forall D\\in\\mathbf{PPT}\\;\\left(n\\mapsto\\left|\\Pr[D(1^n,X_n)=1]-\\Pr[D(1^n,Y_n)=1]\\right|\\right)\\in\\mathrm{Negl}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal X\\approx_c\\mathcal Y\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\forall D\\in\\mathbf{PPT}\\;\\left(n\\mapsto\\left|\\Pr[D(1^n,X_n)=1]-\\Pr[D(1^n,Y_n)=1]\\right|\\right)\\in\\mathrm{Negl}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>一元参数是均匀算法的显式输入，不是非一致 advice。此节点抽取第 9 章“所有多项式时间区分器”的语义为通用接口；书中定义 9.8 的 PRG 按仅提供样本的专门接口独立定义，不能把任意索引族直接代入本节点的自然数索引定义。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-ensemble","status":"resolved","id":"46982b39fb15e783","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-ensemble]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-ppt","status":"resolved","id":"b75200f005282ddf","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-ppt]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-negl","status":"resolved","id":"f3171800627deef3","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-negl]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-binary-pair-encoding","status":"resolved","id":"0dfeff4bd5d69b86","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-binary-pair-encoding]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-ensemble","status":"resolved","id":"46982b39fb15e783","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal X=(X_n)_{n\\in\\mathbb N},\\mathcal Y=(Y_n)_{n\\in\\mathbb N}\\in\\operatorname{Ens}(\\mathbb N)$，见 [[28-df-ensemble]]。","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-ppt","status":"resolved","id":"b75200f005282ddf","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$D\\in\\mathbf{PPT}$ 为均匀随机多项式时间的一比特输出区分器，见 [[28-df-ppt]]；$\\mathrm{Negl}$ 见 [[28-df-negl]]。","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-negl","status":"resolved","id":"f3171800627deef3","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$D\\in\\mathbf{PPT}$ 为均匀随机多项式时间的一比特输出区分器，见 [[28-df-ppt]]；$\\mathrm{Negl}$ 见 [[28-df-negl]]。","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-binary-pair-encoding","status":"resolved","id":"0dfeff4bd5d69b86","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{pair}_{01}$ 见 [[28-df-binary-pair-encoding]]；$D(1^n,z)\\coloneqq D(\\operatorname{pair}_{01}(1^n,z))$；概率同时取遍分布样本与区分器的独立随机性。$\\approx_c$ 为以下关系。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal X=(X_n)_{n\\in\\mathbb N},\\mathcal Y=(Y_n)_{n\\in\\mathbb N}\\in\\operatorname{Ens}(\\mathbb N)","display":false},{"tex":"a,c\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{supp}(X_n)\\cup\\operatorname{supp}(Y_n)\\subseteq\\{0,1\\}^{\\le c(n+1)^a}","display":false},{"tex":"D\\in\\mathbf{PPT}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Negl}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{pair}_{01}","display":false},{"tex":"D(1^n,z)\\coloneqq D(\\operatorname{pair}_{01}(1^n,z))","display":false},{"tex":"\\approx_c","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal X\\approx_c\\mathcal Y\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\forall D\\in\\mathbf{PPT}\\;\\left(n\\mapsto\\left|\\Pr[D(1^n,X_n)=1]-\\Pr[D(1^n,Y_n)=1]\\right|\\right)\\in\\mathrm{Negl}.","display":true}],"bytes":1891,"backlinks":[{"id":"439ca13b3038aae3","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-148","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"分布与视图：[[28-df-ensemble]]、[[28-df-view]]、[[28-df-statistical-distance]]、[[28-df-computational-indistinguishability]]。"}],"outgoing":["46982b39fb15e783","b75200f005282ddf","f3171800627deef3","0dfeff4bd5d69b86"]}